{"name":"Samra","status":"ok","title":"Samra","pageId":9058,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Samra</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p63_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p63-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Small town</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chondath\" title=\"Chondath\">Chondath</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Vilhon_Reach\" title=\"Vilhon Reach\">Vilhon Reach</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"imports\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Imports</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Lumber<sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p5_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p5-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Fish<sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p63_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p63-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p63_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p63-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"government\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Council of elders</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rulertype\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mayor</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mayor</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malil_Entwine\" title=\"Malil Entwine\">Malil Entwine</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"established\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Established</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/50_DR\" title=\"50 DR\">50 DR</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p4_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p4-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Samra</b> is a small fishing town in <a href=\"/wiki/Chondath\" title=\"Chondath\">Chondath</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p63_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p63-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-32_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-32-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Connections\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Connections</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Samra?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Samra was a relatively small fishing town. It had few defenses and no walls. The city had docks, but they were unaccommodating for bigger vessels, leaving Samra deprived of a huge part of the trade in the <a href=\"/wiki/Vilhon_Reach\" title=\"Vilhon Reach\">Vilhon Reach</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p63_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p63-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Samra?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Samra stood on the southern shore of the Vilhon Reach, in the immediate vicinity from <a href=\"/wiki/Iljak\" title=\"Iljak\">Iljak</a> to the west and <a href=\"/wiki/Shamph\" title=\"Shamph\">Shamphto</a> the south. Two trade routes could be found to the city's south – the <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Road_(Vilhon_Reach)\" title=\"Old Road (Vilhon Reach)\">Old Road</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Way\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Emerald Way\">Emerald Way</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-map_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-map-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-fr3-map_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-fr3-map-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> An underwater <a href=\"/wiki/Merfolk\" title=\"Merfolk\">merfolk</a> town was in the Vilhon, north of Samra, in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Echoing Canyon (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRWNob2luZ19DYW55b24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Echoing Canyon</span> of <span class=\"new\" title=\"Ovlos (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvT3Zsb3M/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Ovlos</span>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-sof-p48_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-sof-p48-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government\">Government</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Government\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Samra?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Government\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Samra is ruled by a mayor and a council of elected elders. <i>Circa</i> the late-14<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, the title of the mayor belonged to <a href=\"/wiki/Malil_Entwine\" title=\"Malil Entwine\">Malil Entwine</a>, the owner of a local fishing company. Samra paid taxes to the capital of <a href=\"/wiki/Arrabar\" title=\"Arrabar\">Arrabar</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p63_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p63-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The city of Iljak showed mistrust and caution when dealing with its neighboring Samra, the attitude caused by a war of many centuries prior. by the 14<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, Iljak outgrew Samra. Sages said that Samra was \"living on the good graces of Iljak.\" Samra and Shamph's relations were strained as well. Sapra's government's stance was that Shamph should maintain order in the region and build peace between feuding Chondathan cities.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p5_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p5-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p63_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p63-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Samra?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Samra was founded in the <a href=\"/wiki/50_DR\" title=\"50 DR\">Year of the Barbed Wind, 50 DR</a> on the southeastern shore of the Vilhon, the same year that gave birth to the cities of <a href=\"/wiki/Mussum\" title=\"Mussum\">Mussum</a> and Arrabar.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p4_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p4-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The <a href=\"/wiki/137_DR\" title=\"137 DR\">Year of the King's Destiny, 137 DR</a> brought conflict to Samra. The city of Iljak became embittered by its trade competition with Samra and Mussum, and on <a href=\"/wiki/Flamerule_12\" title=\"Flamerule 12\">Flamerule 12</a>, it sent armies to Mussum. While Iljak and Mussum were locked in a stalemate, Samra sent its own armies in early <span class=\"new\" title=\"Eleasius (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRWxlYXNpdXM/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Eleasius</span>. Samra raided Iljak and then flanked Iljak's armies, winning the war following Iljak's surrender. The cities of Mussum and Samra sold the surviving inhabitants and warriors of Iljak into slavery and torched the city.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p5_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p5-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/139_DR\" title=\"139 DR\">Year of the Resolute Courtesans, 139 DR</a>, Samra became one of the importers of <a href=\"/wiki/Chondalwood\" title=\"Chondalwood\">Chondalwood</a> lumber. By the <a href=\"/wiki/143_DR\" title=\"143 DR\">Year of the Smiling Princess, 143 DR</a>, the cities that would later become <a href=\"/wiki/Chondath\" title=\"Chondath\">Chondath</a>, under the leadership of <a href=\"/wiki/Anthony_Illistine\" title=\"Anthony Illistine\">Anthony Illistine</a>, attacked and destroyed the elven city of <a href=\"/wiki/Ariel-than\" title=\"Ariel-than\">Ariel-than</a> of Chondalwood. The massacre became known as the <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_of_the_Elven_Tears\" title=\"Battle of the Elven Tears\">Battle of the Elven Tears</a> and was retaliation for elves attempting to halt Chondathan lumbering operations. Six months after the Battle of the Elven Tears, Lord Anthony Illistine became the first Governor of Chondath and assembled the city-states of Arrabar, Mussum, Samra, and Shamph into the nation of Chondath.<sup id=\"cite_ref-VH-p5_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VH-p5-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Samra?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Gallery\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Samra?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Gallery\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"e3d2d135984c573698b140ae56dc97f4\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><i>A 13<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a> map showing Samra.</i></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><i>A late 14<sup>th</sup> century DR map showing the location of Samra.</i></div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-secti